Parity logic ported 1:1 from the web source:
  • efficiency = analytics?.avg_efficiency_wh_km ?? 0   (SI Wh/km)
  • score = efficiency > 0 ? min(100, round((250 / efficiency) * 100)) : 0
  • gauge color: score>75 green / >50 amber / else red   → TSTone success/warning/danger
  • toEfficiencyDisplay: ×1.609344 for miles (Wh/km→Wh/mi); identity for km
  • stat: Efficiency = fmtNumber(toDisplay(efficiency), 0) + unit
  • analytics ? <gauge hero> : EmptyState("No data yet"); shell loading/error + freshness chip/banner
Registry: drive-score · driving · default 1×2 · min 1×2 · max 2×40 (clamped), id + size envelope honored.
i18n keys extracted from source (all resolve through the P1/S10 facade, no English literals in code):
  widget.score = "Score" · widget.efficiency = "Efficiency" · widget.noScore = "No data yet"

